# Project 4 — Implementation Evidence

This folder contains screenshots captured during the implementation and validation of the Azure Policy & Governance project.

The evidence demonstrates the configuration of Azure governance, management hierarchy, policy controls, identity and access management, resource organization, monitoring, networking, and cost management.

